Sigma)\\land\\theta=(\\neg\\varphi)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}negation} \\vdash \\mathrm{NegationFormula}_S(\\theta,\\varphi,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow \\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\\theta=(\\neg\\varphi)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The output formula is constructed syntactically; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> is a set and is therefore used by membership, not as a predicate on formulas.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)$ (formula set, see [[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NegationFormula}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}negation} \\vdash \\mathrm{NegationFormula}_S(\\theta,\\varphi,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow \\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\\theta=(\\neg\\varphi)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)","display":false}],"bytes":829,"backlinks":[{"id":"9ab7d3064766870c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\neg$ (negation connective, see [